      "title": "AiRBase 99 Operating Manual",
      "notes": "The MIDI implementation's controller tables (PDF pages 29 - 31), read by tools/profiles/jomox/read-jomox-cc.mjs from AirBase99_E.pdf (sha256 6d6de0a53133974672557be8da1146980763d230b85ed4e7f15aea6c63040103), https://www.jomox.de/upload/manuals/AirBase99_E.pdf, linked from https://www.jomox.de/support.php?lang=2&product_id=7. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/jomox/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/jomox/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI implementation, sent as the controller it prints, on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "A value range named one each by the internal range beside it (`0/64  Off/On`) is a choice; values printed without names are a choice of those values; every other range is a number, its internal range or resolution in its description.",
    "The table is read up to \"Extended LFO Parameters\"; what follows is not rows of controllers."
  ],
